WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:13.424
The ogre stomped around the room.

2
00:00:13.425 --> 00:00:26.408
He sniffed every corner.

3
00:00:26.409 --> 00:00:29.807
Suddenly he stopped.

4
00:00:29.808 --> 00:00:35.519
"Fee, fi, fo, fum," the ogre yelled.

5
00:00:35.520 --> 00:00:39.325
"I smell an Englishman!

6
00:00:39.326 --> 00:00:43.723
If he's alive, or if he's dead,

7
00:00:43.724 --> 00:00:49.976
I'll eat him on a slice of bread!"

8
00:00:49.977 --> 00:00:53.206
Inside the oven Jack shook with fear.

9
00:00:53.207 --> 00:00:56.559
"This is awful," he thought.

10
00:00:56.560 --> 00:00:59.212
"The ogre is going to find me.

11
00:00:59.213 --> 00:01:05.069
Then he'll put me on bread and eat me!"

12
00:01:05.070 --> 00:01:08.674
Jack bit his hand so he wouldn't cry.

13
00:01:08.675 --> 00:01:16.228
"I'll never see Mother again," he thought.

14
00:01:16.229 --> 00:01:21.898
"Why did I take those beans?"

15
00:01:21.899 --> 00:01:32.867
"Fee, fi, fo, fum!" the angry ogre yelled again.

16
00:01:32.868 --> 00:01:37.220
"The smell is not an Englishman.

17
00:01:37.221 --> 00:01:42.811
It's an English boy!"

18
00:01:42.812 --> 00:01:47.396
"Now, now, dear," his wife said.

19
00:01:47.397 --> 00:01:49.783
"I don't smell a thing."

20
00:01:49.784 --> 00:01:56.230
She gave a little laugh. "You must be dreaming."

21
00:01:56.231 --> 00:01:59.895
"I'm not dreaming!" the ogre said.

22
00:01:59.896 --> 00:02:03.336
"I smell a boy!"

23
00:02:03.337 --> 00:02:07.912
His wife patted his arm. "Breakfast will be ready soon.

24
00:02:07.913 --> 00:02:10.349
Why don't you go and wash up?"

25
00:02:10.350 --> 00:02:20.859
The ogre growled, still sniffing.

26
00:02:20.860 --> 00:02:25.473
"I'll make pancakes too," his wife said sweetly.

27
00:02:25.474 --> 00:02:28.186
The ogre turned his huge head.

28
00:02:28.187 --> 00:02:31.886
"With blueberries?" he asked.

29
00:02:31.887 --> 00:02:36.977
His wife nodded. "Yes, of course, dear."

30
00:02:36.978 --> 00:02:39.040
The ogre's shoulders dropped.

31
00:02:39.041 --> 00:02:40.837
His frown melted away.

32
00:02:40.838 --> 00:02:50.326
"Okay," he said. "I'll wash up."

